        "specialDays": null,
        "assessment": [
          "EVALUATION FOR THE SKILLS AND THE CONTENT: PERFORMANCE ASSIGNMENT: Students will prepare a project titled “My Favourite Character”. This character can be anyone or anything such as a real person, a cartoon character or a character from an animation etc. First, they will draw their character on a paper or they may use Web 2.0 tools. The drawings should include some details such as physical appearance, body parts, clothing, and dressing. Then, students will write a short paragraph about their character. The paragraphs should include some details about the characters’ personality traits. Students will present their work to the class. The assignment will be evaluated by using a rubric scheme, a rating scale, and/or a marking scheme."
        ]
