        "specialDays": null,
        "assessment": [
          "EVALUATION FOR THE SKILLS AND THE CONTENT: PERFORMANCE ASSIGNMENT: Students will take on the role of a teacher or student for common classroom challenges and for comparing traditional and online learning. They will describe some past experiences such as “I was able to sort out the issue” or “We have been able to engage students more effectively”. Students will discuss the pros and cons of each learning environment, for example, “Online learning might feel isolating” or “Traditional learning can be more interactive”. They will incorporate modals for deduction, saying things such as “The problem was solved by changing the seating” or “It must have been hard to focus online”. Finally, students will create a poster comparing both methods and present their findings, demonstrating their ability to use the grammar structures in a real-world context. The assignment will be evaluated by using a rubric scheme, a rating scale, and/or a marking scheme."
        ]
